==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|schaden}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|skathon}}, from {{inh|nl|gmw-pro|*skaþōn}}, from {{inh|nl|gem-pro|*skaþōną}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|scathe}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nl|/ˈsxaːdə(n)/}}
* {{rhymes|nl|aːdən|s=2}}
* {{audio|nl|Nl-schade (Belgium).ogg|audio (Belgium)}}
* {{audio|nl|Nl-schaden.ogg|audio (Netherlands)}}

===Verb===
{{nl-verb}}

# {{lb|nl|intransitive}} to [[damage]], to [[harm]], to [[hurt]]
#: {{syn|nl|beschadigen}}

====Inflection====
{{nl-conj-wk|schaad|schade}}

