==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|schaden}}, from {{inh|de|goh|scadōn}}, from the root of the noun {{m|de|Schaden|t=damage, harm}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈʃaːdn̩/}}
* {{audio|de|De-schaden.ogg|audio}}
* {{audio|de|De-schaden2.ogg|audio}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb}}

# {{lb|de|intransitive}} to [[hurt]], to be [[harmful]]
#: {{ux|de|Es kann nicht schaden, es mal zu versuchen.|It can't hurt to give it a try.}}
# {{lb|de|with dative object}} to [[damage]], to [[harm]], to [[hurt]]
#: {{ux|de|Der Fehler hat seinem Ruf geschadet.|The mistake harmed his reputation.}}

